**Parity fidelity:** SI formatting ports match `numberFormat.ts` + `unitConversion.ts` exactly (precision, grouping, no-space °unit), including the web's verbatim quirks (charger Watts labelled "kW", energy Wh labelled "kWh", charge-rate = `formatSpeed(range_added_meters_per_hour/3600)`); tire-pressure Pa thresholds + verdict; ±300 kW power bar; fan ladder; presence chips. All 5 states render (loading/empty/error/content + live/stale/offline freshness axis with one-shot stale auto-refresh), data binds through the P1/S8 state-holder seam, 96 i18n keys with **0 referenced-but-undeclared**, VoiceOver labels + Reduce Motion throughout, and `view.opened` telemetry on the P1/S11 contract.

